 parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/accessibilityRespondsToUserInteraction(_:isEnabled:)":{"type":"topic","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/accessibilityRespondsToUserInteraction(_:isEnabled:)","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/accessibilityrespondstouserinteraction(_:isenabled:)","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"accessibilityRespondsToUserInteraction","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isEnabled","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ModifiedContent","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI15ModifiedContentV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AccessibilityAttachmentModifier","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI31AccessibilityAttachmentModifierV"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"title":"accessibilityRespon